# Meridian Kernel .gitignore
#
# Second line of defence only. The first is that the Instance is a different
# repository entirely and is not reachable from here by a relative path.

# Instance checkouts, if someone places one inside this working tree anyway.
/instance/
/instances/
/.agent/
/meridian-instance-*/
/*-instance/

# Secrets — never, in any form.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials*.json
secrets*.yaml
secrets*.yml

# Transient.
tmp/
_to_delete/
*.tmp
evidence/raw/
screenshots/
*.har

# Tooling. Local editor and viewer state: the Kernel is a folder of Markdown and
# can be opened by any tool that reads one as a graph. Whatever config such a
# tool leaves behind is that operator's, not the Kernel's.
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
.obsidian/
*.log
